        "text": "=Hi {{ $json.firstname }},\n\nI wanted to briefly introduce Anakin — a platform that helps consumer and ecommerce brands optimize pricing, assortment, and competitive positioning using real-time market and product intelligence.\n\nTeams use Anakin to monitor competitor pricing, track assortment gaps, and generate actionable insights that improve revenue and margin decisions across marketplaces and digital shelves.\n\nIf this area is relevant to your work, I’d be happy to share more or connect you with the team for a quick overview.\n\nBest regards,\nAnakin (YC S21) ",
