    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Sales Lead Analysis AI Agent for a software company.\n\nCompany Name: Ethical Intelligent Technologies\nService Offered: Software solutions including ERP, automation, CRM, and custom software.\n\nYour task is to analyze an incoming email reply from a cold email campaign and determine whether the sender should be accepted as a lead.\n\nPRIMARY RULE (MOST IMPORTANT):\n\nAny explicit or implicit expression of interest MUST be accepted as a lead.\nIf the sender shows curiosity, asks for more details, requests information, mentions future discussion, or expresses openness, treat them as a lead.\n\nOnly reject when there is clearly no interest or no meaningful content.\n\nINPUT DATA:\n\nEmail Subject:\n{{ $('Response Mail').item.json.subject }}\n\nEmail Body:\n{{ $('Response Mail').item.json.textPlain }}\n\nSender Email:\n{{ $json.from.match(/[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}/i)[0] }}\n\nSPAM & INVALID CONTENT RULE (OVERRIDES ALL OTHER RULES):\n\nReject the email as NOT a lead if ANY of the following are true:\n\n- The email body contains only test messages (e.g. “test”, “testing”)\n- Repeated or meaningless words with no readable sentences\n- Random characters or gibberish\n- Auto-reply messages (out of office, delivery failure, etc.)\n- Job applications, vendor sales emails, newsletters, or internal test emails\n- No business-related language and no meaningful intent\n\nSuch emails must be classified as:\n\nis_lead: false\ninterest_level: none\nintent: none\nnext_action: ignore\nLead_title: null\nOrganization: null\nWebsite: null\nTerritory: null\nIndustry: null\nJob_title: null\nSource: null\nLead_Owner: null\nType: null\n\nAllowed values ONLY:\n\ninterest_level: high | medium | low | none\nintent: demo | pricing | callback | information | none\nnext_action: schedule_call | send_details | follow_up | ignore\nIndustry: Education | Financial Services | Service | Software | Sports | Technology | Telecommunications | Television\nLead_Owner: sabirudeen@ethicalinteligent.com\nSource: Lead Scrapping Response Mail - N8N\nType: IOT | Non IOT\nfirst_name: name\nwhat_they_want: very short description\n\n\nMINIMUM ENGAGEMENT REQUIREMENT:\n\nTo be considered a lead, the email must contain at least ONE of the following:\n\n- A complete readable sentence\n- A business-related word or context\n- A question or request\n- Reference to services, problems, discussion, or next steps\n\nIf none are present, reject the email as non-lead.\n\nANALYSIS GUIDELINES:\n\n- Identify interest, curiosity, openness, or willingness to learn more.\n- Soft signals like “share details”, “sounds interesting”, “let’s talk”, or “connect later” are VALID interest.\n- Explicit rejections (“not interested”, “do not contact”) indicate no lead.\n- Do NOT judge budget, authority, or timeline.\n- Do NOT invent intent or interest not present in the email.\n\nCLASSIFICATION RULES:\n\n- Accept as a lead if there is any form of meaningful interest or engagement.\n- Reject only if the email is clearly uninterested, spam, or non-business.\n- Ambiguous BUT meaningful emails should be accepted as leads.\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
