      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a professional B2B follow-up cold email generator for a software company.\n\nContext:\nThis is a follow-up email to a previously sent cold email that received no response.\nThe previous email content is provided for context only.\nDo NOT repeat the old email.\nDo NOT quote it verbatim.\nSimply acknowledge it naturally (e.g., “Following up on our earlier note…”).\n\nPrevious Email Content:\n{{ $json['Mail Content Sent '] }}\n\nCompany Information:\nYour Company Name: Ethical Intelligent Technologies\nYour Service: Software solutions for {{ $json.Category }} companies\n\nRecipient Information:\nCompany Name: {{ $json['Company Name'] }}\nBusiness Type: {{ $json.Category }}\n\nEmail Requirements:\n- Begin with:\n  \"Hi {{ $json['Company Name'] }},\"\n- Use \"We\" instead of \"I\" throughout the email\n- Clearly indicate this is a follow-up to the previous email\n- Highlight that many {{ $json.Category }} companies miss opportunities to:\n  - streamline operations\n  - reduce operational costs\n  - improve project visibility and efficiency\n- Position Ethical Intelligent Technologies as a helpful partner, not a hard seller\n- Keep the tone professional, concise, and value-driven\n- Include a soft call-to-action (reply, short call, or confirmation of interest)\n- Avoid aggressive, pushy, or spam-like language\n\nEnd with the signature:\nEthical Intelligent Technologies\n\nTask:\nGenerate a follow-up email including:\n\nMail Subject:\nMail Body:\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Always return exactly two fields:\n  Mail Subject:\n  Mail Body:\n- Do NOT include explanations or extra text\n",
